    "but every placement is anchored to a spoken phrase ([phrase, offset]) so the plan",
    "survives a re-cut or a re-supplied source. `start`/`end` on a beat are the hint the",
    "phrase resolver uses when a phrase occurs more than once.",
    "",
    "Doctrine: the hook (first 20s) stays on his face. B-roll goes where the words are",
    "about things the viewer cannot see (the factory, the units, the tests). Cards go",
    "where the words carry a number, a list or a phase. One thing owns the coral per view.",
    "",
